  "store": {
    "tagline": "Poster sala, pitanja po štandu i poziv u Google Meet.",
    "description": "## BS\n\nIstraživanja zaslužuju razgovor. Organizator bira 1–24 prezentatora, priprema štandove i PDF/slikovne postere. Učesnici u zajedničkoj sali biraju avatar, kreću se tastaturom, klikom ili dodirom, ili koriste pretraživu listu. Svaki štand ima svoja pitanja i odgovore. Jednokratne privatne pozivnice dodjeljuju prezentatorski štand.\n\nOriginalna retro pixel sala, topli drveni pod, tamnoplavi okvir, urednik lika, PSI ikona i BS/EN. Demo teme su izričito fiktivne. Prikazuju se samo stvarne sesije koje su se javile serveru.\n\nOrganizator može svakom štandu dodati Google Meet link. Pri dolasku učesnik bira **Pridruži se razgovoru / Samo poster**. Poziv se otvara odvojeno; PSI ne uključuje mikrofon, ne kreira sastanke i ne prekida Meet kada učesnik napusti štand.\n\nVeće dodirne kontrole i čitljivija originalna pixel slova prilagođeni su manjim ekranima. DOM tokovi su provjereni na 360/800 px; stvarni Android i prelazak u Meet još čekaju korisničku provjeru.\n\n**Trenutna verzija je privatna, bez ugrađenog audija uživo i javnog gostujućeg ulaza.** Ne tvrdi neograničen kapacitet ili potpunu konferencijsku audio podršku.\n\n## EN\n\nResearch deserves a conversation. Set up 1–24 poster booths, explore a shared 2D hall, view PDF/image posters and keep questions beside the right research. Held keyboard/touch controls and click paths move your character; the searchable list walks you to a booth. One-time private invitations assign presenters to their booths.\n\nOriginal retro pixel hall, warm wooden floors, dark-blue frame, character editor, PSI artwork and Bosnian/English interface. Sample themes are explicitly fictional; presence comes from real server sessions, not simulated visitors.\n\nOrganizers can assign a Google Meet link to each booth. On arrival, visitors choose **Join conversation / Poster only**. The call opens separately; PSI does not activate a microphone, create meetings or end a Meet call when someone leaves a booth.\n\nLarger touch controls and clearer original pixel lettering support smaller screens. DOM flows were checked at 360/800 px; physical Android and the Meet app handoff still need user verification.\n\n**This revision is private, without built-in live audio or public guest entry.** It does not claim unlimited capacity or complete conference audio support.",
    "screenshots": [
      {
        "src": "static/store/hall.png",
        "alt": "Stvarna PSI sala sa šest jasno fiktivnih tema i likom trenutnog učesnika.",
